2. Background and Related Work
2.1. RAG systems
In recent advances in natural language processing, RAG has emerged as an effective framework for integrating external knowledge into language models (
[Zhao et al. 2024](#bib.bib73)
;
[Arslan et al. 2024](#bib.bib6)
) . A RAG system consists of three components: a Knowledge Database (
